            "show_payment_icons": "first",
            "first_title": "Expert Review",
            "first_text": "<p>This magnetic power bank punches well above its price. The 15W MagSafe-compatible wireless output locks on firmly, and PD 20W wired charging keeps things fast when you need a quick top-up. The metal alloy chassis feels premium and adds almost no bulk to your phone. A smart choice for anyone tired of carrying cables everywhere.</p>",
            "second_title": "Description",
            "second_text": "<p>Ultra-slim magnetic wireless power bank with premium alloy shell and built-in LED battery display. Compatible with iPhone 12 and newer for snap-on wireless charging, and works with any Qi-enabled device. Features USB-C input/output for two-way fast charging at up to 20W. Available in 5000mAh and 10000mAh capacities.</p>",
            "third_title": "Specs",
            "third_text": "<p><strong>Wireless Output:</strong> 15W magnetic (MagSafe compatible)</p><p><strong>Wired Output:</strong> PD 20W USB-C</p><p><strong>Input:</strong> USB-C / Lightning, 20W max</p><p><strong>Battery:</strong> Li-polymer, 5000mAh or 10000mAh</p><p><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 104 × 66 × 7.8 mm (5000mAh)</p><p><strong>Weight:</strong> 118 g (5000mAh) / 180 g (10000mAh)</p><p><strong>Certifications:</strong> CE, FCC, RoHS</p>",
